flowchart LR
    Human[Human user]
    OwnerUI[Streamlit PawPal+ UI]
    CLI[CLI demo]
    Domain[Owner, Pet, Task, Scheduler]
    Knowledge[(knowledge_base/pet_care.json)]

    Human -->|manages pets and asks questions| OwnerUI
    OwnerUI -->|pet and task operations| Domain
    CLI -->|schedule operations| Domain

    subgraph RAG[Pet-care RAG assistant]
        Input[Validate question]
        Retrieve[Keyword-overlap retrieval]
        Risk{High-risk question?}
        HasSources{Relevant passages found?}
        Prompt[Build prompt from question and retrieved context]
        Ollama[Local Ollama model<br/>gemma3:1b by default]
        Grounding{Answer safe and context-related?}
        ModelAnswer[Model-generated answer]
        SafetyAnswer[Safety response<br/>model not called]
        Insufficient[Insufficient-information response<br/>model not called]
        Fallback[Evidence-only extractive fallback]
        Response[Answer, method label, and available source references]

        Input --> Retrieve
        Retrieve --> Risk
        Risk -->|yes| SafetyAnswer
        Risk -->|no| HasSources
        HasSources -->|no| Insufficient
        HasSources -->|yes: question and passages| Prompt
        Prompt -->|context-grounded request| Ollama
        Ollama --> Grounding
        Grounding -->|safe and context-related| ModelAnswer
        Grounding -->|unsafe or ungrounded| Fallback
        Ollama -. service unavailable .-> Fallback
        ModelAnswer --> Response
        SafetyAnswer --> Response
        Insufficient --> Response
        Fallback --> Response
    end

    OwnerUI --> Input
    Knowledge --> Retrieve
    Response -->|answer and sources for review| OwnerUI
    OwnerUI -->|displays answer and references| Human

    subgraph Verification[Offline verification]
        Tests[pytest suite<br/>fakes and mocked service failures]
        Evaluation[evaluate_rag.py<br/>expected retrieval hits and lexical overlap]
        Metrics[Evaluation metrics<br/>not a factuality proof]
        TestDoubles[Fake generators and mocked Ollama HTTP]

        Evaluation --> Retrieve
        Evaluation --> Fallback
        Evaluation --> Metrics
        Tests -. verifies component behavior .-> Retrieve
        Tests -. uses .-> TestDoubles
        TestDoubles -. stand in for .-> Ollama
    end